# CR 613.8a the other way round: impending's "As long as this permanent has a time counter on it, it isn't a creature"
# changes what Ygra's "Other creatures are Food artifacts" applies to, so Ygra's effect waits for it although Overlord of the
# Balemurk entered later. Once it isn't a creature, Ygra's effect does not apply to it: it is an enchantment alone, no
# artifact and no Food. In timestamp order Ygra's effect would have found an enchantment creature and made it a Food artifact.
# (ygra-makes-a-vehicle-crewed-after-it-a-food-artifact-by-dependency is the positive case of the same dependency.)

